/**
 * Public-page icon inventory (UI design §0.3: Hugeicons, 1.5px stroke).
 *
 * Imports use the package barrel with named exports. hugeicons-react ships one
 * generated module per icon and marks itself `sideEffects: false`, so the
 * bundler prunes every unused re-export; the public-page bundle budget
 * (F-09-06: ≤150 KB gzip first screen) is verified by
 * `scripts/check_bundle_size.sh`. This file is the only place public pages
 * import icons from, so a future per-icon switch is one edit.
 *
 * Names follow the icons actually generated by hugeicons-react 0.4.0; a few
 * design-spec names (`Gauge`, `Boxes`, `Network`) have no generated export, so
 * the closest semantic icon is used (documented per entry).
 */
